{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/45318-london-uk-nwod-london-darkness-roleplaying-club","id":45318,"title":"[London, UK; NWOD] London Darkness Roleplaying Club","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-08T20:00:08-08:00","id":45318,"title":"[London, UK; NWOD] London Darkness Roleplaying Club","content":"London Darkness Roleplaying Club (previously known as London NWOD) is back! <b>LDRC's next session will be held on either 19/01/2014 or 26/05/2014, between 13:00 GMT +0:00 (1PM in the UK) to 16:00 GMT +0:00 (4PM in the UK). LDRC is based at The Pirate Castle, which is located in Camden Town in North-West London.</b> <b>If you are interested in attending, email us as soon as possible at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#83efecede7ecedadedf4ece7c3e4eee2eaefade0ecee\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"6d01020309020343031a02092d0a000c0401430e0200\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> with the date you can attend in the body.</b> Directions and other details will be provided once your email has been received. <b>We welcome experienced gamers and new players alike! Players MUST be 18+ (safety and security reasons).</b> Our club plays any and all official New World of Darkness templates currently available (e.g. Vampire, Werewolf, Mage), as well as recently released and future templates (e.g. Mummy, Demon). We will be running a Mage The Awakening game on one table and another game (TBD) on another table. <b>A \u00a34 contribution towards the club fund (we are a not-for-profit club and your contribution helps with the running costs each session) for the venue is required which you can -- and must -- pay on the date of the session.</b> All contributions are collected at the start of the session (or on your arrival if for any reason you are late) and are then deposited at the venue directly at the end of the session. If you know anyone at all who would also be interested in joining this group, you are welcome to bring them along to the session (provided they also contribute \u00a34 on the day). If you are bringing someone along, please can you provide us with their contact details -- with their permission, of course. We are looking to bring on one additional Gamemaster for the sessions going forward. This role will be a voluntary, &quot;full-time&quot; (i.e. weekly) position. Further details will be provided to applicants (incl. responsibilities, scheduling, potential compensation, game content and so on). If you are interested in becoming an LDRC sanctioned Gamemaster, please send your application via a seperate email at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#294546474d464707475e464d694e44484045074a4644\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"54383b3a303b3a7a3a233b30143339353d387a373b39\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> and include in the email body your first and last name, age, your availability on Sundays, your experience with World of Darkness (both New and Old), your experience as a GM (World of Darkness preferred but not essential) and what you feel are your qualities and limits are as GM. Once this email has been received, your information will be filed for reference* and you will be informed in due time if your application will be advanced to the next stage. That's it for now. We look forward to seeing you at our next session! <b>PLAYER FEEDBACK:</b> &quot;<i>I just wanted to say that I really appreciated the game yesterday. I've not seen that style of game done very well before and you carried the day nicely. </i>[...]<i> Just wanted to send some thanks</i>&quot; -- J.W &quot;<i>That was fun!</i>&quot; -- S.J (One of our newest members) &quot;<i>I love roleplaying and i really enjoy coming to london NWOD because they get what rpgs are about. </i>[...]<i> I missed out on a whole extra week of skiing and snowboarding because i missed the group and the people there too much!</i>&quot; -- M.L (We couldn't believe it either!) &quot;<i>It was the right level of mystery and the way that ghost/shadow creature was stalking us, I could really feel the suspense. Superb game mate.</i>&quot; -- P.N.C (A new member from our 5th session) &quot;<i>I felt like I could ease into the game. I didn't feel overwhelmed. It's better for me when I do things firsthand </i>[...]<i> and I felt that I got choices. Definitely coming back!</i>&quot; -- J.R (A new member from our 6th session who had no previous RPG, P'n'P or WOD experience before our session) If you're unfamiliar with the World of Darkness, check out these links: Summary: <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/World_of_Darkness\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/World_of_Darkness</a> List of templates: <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Portal:World_of_Darkness\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Port...ld_of_Darkness</a> Look us up on <b>UK Role Players</b>: <a href=\"http://www.ukroleplayers.com/features/clubs/london-nwod/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.ukroleplayers.com/feature...s/london-nwod/</a> (Always scroll to the bottom of the page to find our latest updates) * Any information provided by applicants will be held and used for the purposes of the application process; and for future reference in such case that other positions arise within the club; and as material in any other capacity when deemed necessary by senior LDRC team members to be accessed only by authorised team members. All such information is treated as private and by providing this information, you confirm you have willingly consented to the aforementioned use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1946-prometheanvigil","name":"PrometheanVigil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T21:50:15-08:00","id":50429,"title":"","content":"UPDATE:<br /> <br /> The next session of LDRC will be hosted on the 26/01/2014 between 13:00 and 15:00.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1946-prometheanvigil","name":"PrometheanVigil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T14:38:45-08:00","id":69430,"title":"","content":"UPDATE:<br /> <br /> The next sessions of LDRC will be hosted on 16/02/2014 and 23/02/2014 between 13:00 and 15:00.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1946-prometheanvigil","name":"PrometheanVigil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T09:34:08-08:00","id":77125,"title":"","content":"UPDATE:<br /> <br /> The next sessions of LDRC will be hosted tomorrow (23/02/2014) and on 02/03/2014 between 13:00 and 16:00 and 13:00 and 15:00 respectively. Please see the top post of this thread for further details on the club and our games. Our email is <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#375b5859535859195940585377505a565e5b1954585a\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"84e8ebeae0ebeaaaeaf3ebe0c4e3e9e5ede8aae7ebe9\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1946-prometheanvigil","name":"PrometheanVigil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T10:32:56-08:00","id":82153,"title":"","content":"<b>UPDATE: LDRC is now on Meetup.com! Check us out here: <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/London-Darkness-Roleplaying-Club/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/London-Darkness-Roleplaying-Club/</a></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> London Darkness Roleplaying Club (previously known as London NWOD) is back!<br /> <br /> <b>LDRC's next session will be held on the 02/03/2014 and then the following week on 09/03/2014, between 13:00 GMT +0:00 (1PM in the UK) to 16:00 GMT +0:00 (4PM in the UK). LDRC is based at The Pirate Castle, which is located in Camden Town in North-West London.</b><br /> <br /> <b>If you are interested in attending, email us as soon as possible at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#294546474d464707475e464d694e44484045074a4644\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"f79b9899939899d999809893b7909a969e9bd994989a\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> with the date you can attend in the body.</b> Directions and other details will be provided once your email has been received. <b>We welcome experienced gamers and new players alike! Players MUST be 18+ (safety and security reasons).</b> Our club plays any and all official New World of Darkness templates currently available (e.g. Vampire, Werewolf, Mage), as well as recently released and future templates (e.g. Mummy, Demon). We will be running a Mage The Awakening game on one table and another game (TBD) on another table.<br /> <br /> [B]A \u00a34 contribution towards the club fund (we are a not-for-profit club and your contribution helps with the running costs and associated expenses each session) for the venue is required which you can -- and must -- pay on the date of the session. All contributions are collected at the start of the session (or on your arrival if for any reason you are late) and are then deposited at the venue directly at the end of the session.<br /> <br /> If you know anyone at all who would also be interested in joining this group, you are welcome to bring them along to the session (provided they also contribute \u00a34 on the day). If you are bringing someone along, please can you provide us with their contact details -- with their permission, of course.<br /> <br /> We are looking to bring on one additional Gamemaster for the sessions going forward. This role will be a voluntary, &quot;full-time&quot; (i.e. weekly) position. Further details will be provided to applicants (incl. responsibilities, scheduling, potential compensation, game content and so on).<br /> <br /> If you are interested in becoming an LDRC sanctioned Gamemaster, please send your application via a seperate email at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e28e8d8c868d8ccc8c958d86a2858f838b8ecc818d8f\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"89e5e6e7ede6e7a7e7fee6edc9eee4e8e0e5a7eae6e4\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> and include in the email body your first and last name, age, your availability on Sundays, your experience with World of Darkness (both New and Old), your experience as a GM (World of Darkness preferred but not essential) and what you feel are your qualities and limits are as GM. Once this email has been received, your information will be filed for reference* and you will be informed in due time if your application will be advanced to the next stage.<br /> <br /> That's it for now. We look forward to seeing you at our next session!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>PLAYER FEEDBACK:</b><br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I just wanted to say that I really appreciated the game yesterday.<br /> I've not seen that style of game done very well before and you carried the day nicely. </i>[...]<i><br /> Just wanted to send some thanks</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -- J.W (One of our very first members)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>That was fun!</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -- S.J (One of our earliest members)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I love roleplaying and i really enjoy coming to london NWOD because they get what rpgs are about. </i>[...]<i><br /> I missed out on a whole extra week of skiing and snowboarding because i missed the group and the people there too much!</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -- M.L (We couldn't believe it either!)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>It was the right level of mystery and the way that ghost/shadow creature was stalking us,<br /> I could really feel the suspense. Superb game mate.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -- P.N.C (A new member from our 5th session)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I felt like I could ease into the game. I didn't feel overwhelmed.<br /> It's better for me when I do things firsthand </i>[...]<i> and I felt that I got choices.<br /> Definitely coming back!</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -- J.R (A new member from our 6th session who had no previous RPG, P'n'P or WOD experience before our session)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>The best roleplaying I've had in a long time.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -- C.A (One of our newest members)<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Thumbs up!</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -- V.N (One of our newest, female members -- we're a pretty diverse bunch here at LDRC!)<br /> <br /> If you're unfamiliar with the World of Darkness, check out these links:<br /> Summary: <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/World_of_Darkness\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/World_of_Darkness</a><br /> List of templates: <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Portal:World_of_Darkness\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Port...ld_of_Darkness</a><br /> <br /> <b>Check out London NWOD around the web:</b><br /> <br /> <b><i>Find us on Meetup.com</i></b>: <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/London-Darkness-Roleplaying-Club/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/London-Darkness-Roleplaying-Club/</a><br /> <br /> <b>Social Networks</b><br /> Like us on <b>Facebook</b>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/London-NWOD/157995921027559\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/pages/Londo...57995921027559</a><br /> Follow us on <b>Twitter</b> (@LondonNWOD): <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LondonNWOD\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/LondonNWOD</a><br /> <br /> <b>Forums</b><br /> Find us at <b>RPG.NET</b> : <a href=\"http://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?668336-London-UK-LFP-NWOD-Looking-to-start-London-%28UK%29-New-World-of-Darkness-group&amp;p=16479339#post16479339\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?...9#post16479339</a><br /> Find us on <b>Infrno</b>: <a href=\"http://www.infrno.net/games/3430-london-nwod-sunday-session\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.infrno.net/games/3430-lon...sunday-session</a><br /> Find us at <b>Pen and Paper Games</b>: <a href=\"http://www.penandpapergames.com/forums/showthread.php/26727-Join-our-brand-new-World-of-Darkness-group-in-London-UK\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.penandpapergames.com/foru...p-in-London-UK</a>!<br /> Find us at <b>the official White Wolf forums</b>: <a href=\"http://forums.white-wolf.com/default.aspx?g=posts&amp;t=72625\" target=\"_blank\">http://forums.white-wolf.com/default...=posts&amp;t=72625</a><br /> <br /> <b>Other listings</b><br /> Look us up on <b>UK Role Players</b>: <a href=\"http://www.ukroleplayers.com/features/clubs/london-nwod/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.ukroleplayers.com/feature...s/london-nwod/</a><br /> <br /> (Always scroll to the bottom of the thread to find our latest updates)<br /> <br /> *Any information provided by applicants will be held and used for the purposes of the application process; and for future reference in such case that other positions arise within the club; and as material in any other capacity when deemed necessary by senior LDRC team members to be accessed only by authorised team members. All such information is treated as private and by providing this information, you confirm you have willingly consented to the aforementioned use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attach